{"ticker":"KVUE","updated":"2026-11-14T01:10:30Z","profile":{"longName":"Kenvue Inc","shortName":"Kenvue Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","country":"United States","website":"https://www.kenvue.com","fullTimeEmployees":21780,"marketCap":37109346304,"trailingPE":21.943182,"forwardPE":15.589804,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.3895264,"pegRatio":1.53,"targetMeanPrice":19.5,"targetHighPrice":23.0,"targetLowPrice":18.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.032,"earningsGrowth":0.06,"grossMargins":0.58532,"operatingMargins":0.19223,"profitMargins":0.10882,"totalRevenue":15530000384,"beta":0.397,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":20.13,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":15.94,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0435},"summary":"Kenvue Inc. operates as a consumer health company in the United States, rest of North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia-Pacific, and Latin America. It operates in three segments: Self Care, Skin Health and Beauty, and Essential Health. The company offers over-the-counter medicine for cough, cold and allergy, pain care, digestive health, smoking cessation, and eye care, as well as other naturally inspired and self-care products, digital diagnostics, and telemedicine; face and body care, hair, sun, and other care products; oral and baby care, women's health, wound care, and other essential health products; tampons; cosmetics; and vitamins and supplements. It sells its products under the Benadryl, Calpol, Motrin, Nicorette, Rhinocort, Tylenol, Zarbee's Naturals, and Zyrtec; Aveeno, Dr.Ci:Labo, Le Petit Marseillais, Lubriderm, Neutrogena, OGX, and Rogaine; BAND-AID, Carefree, Desitin, Johnson's, Listerine, o.b., and Stayfree; and ORSL, Clean & Clear, Versalie, Benylin, Daktarin, Imodium, Johnson's Baby, Johnson's Adult, Maui Moisture, Microlax, Motilium, Neosporin, Neostrata, Pepcid, Pulmicort, Regaine, Sudafed, and Visine/Vispring/Visclear brands. Kenvue Inc. was incorporated in 2022 and is headquartered in Summit, New Jersey.","summary_zh":"Kenvue Inc. 作為一家消費者健康公司，在美國、北美其他地區、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區和拉丁美洲開展業務。它分為三個部門：自我護理、皮膚健康和美容以及基本健康。該公司提供用於咳嗽、感冒和過敏、疼痛護理、消化健康、戒菸和眼部護理的非處方藥，以及其他自然啟發和自我護理產品、數位診斷和遠距醫療；臉部和身體護理、頭髮、防曬和其他護理產品；口腔和嬰兒護理、女性健康、傷口護理和其他必需保健品；衛生棉條；化妝品；以及維生素和補充劑。它以 Benadryl、Calpol、Motrin、Nicorette、Rhinocort、Tylenol、Zarbee's Naturals 和 Zyrtec 銷售其產品； Aveeno、Dr.Ci:Labo、Le Petit Marseillais、Lubriderm、Neutrogena、OGX 和 Rogaine； BAND-AID、Mam、Desiin、Miron、Desi. ORSL、Clean & Clear、Versalie、Benylin、Daktarin、Imodium、Johnson's Baby、Johnson's Adult、Maui Moisture、Microlax、Motilium、Neosporin、Neostrata、Pepcid、Pulmicort、Regaine、Sudafed 和 Visine/Vispring/Visclear 品牌。 Kenvue Inc. 成立於 2022 年，總部位於新澤西州薩米特。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"居家及個人產品","candles":[{"t":"2026-10-30","o":19.99,"h":20.0,"l":19.2,"c":19.31,"v":66377525}],"earnings":[{"date":"2027-02-04","est":0.27,"act":null,"surp":null}],"quarterly":[{"end":"2026-09-30","rev":3886000000.0,"gp":2314000000.0,"op":739000000.0,"ni":430000000.0,"eps":0.22},{"end":"2026-06-30","rev":3955000000.0,"gp":2301000000.0,"op":758000000.0,"ni":456000000.0,"eps":0.24},{"end":"2026-03-31","rev":3909000000.0,"gp":2302000000.0,"op":838000000.0,"ni":474000000.0,"eps":0.25},{"end":"2025-12-31","rev":3780000000.0,"gp":2137000000.0,"op":632000000.0,"ni":330000000.0,"eps":0.17},{"end":"2025-09-30","rev":3764000000.0,"gp":2226000000.0,"op":713000000.0,"ni":398000000.0,"eps":0.21},{"end":"2025-06-30","rev":null,"gp":null,"op":null,"ni":null,"eps":null},{"end":"2025-03-31","rev":null,"gp":null,"op":null,"ni":null,"eps":null}],"estimates":{"revenue_estimate":{"0q":{"avg":3889336700.0,"low":3838772000.0,"high":4001959000.0,"numberOfAnalysts":6.0,"yearAgoRevenue":3780000000.0,"growth":0.028900001,"currency":null},"+1q":{"avg":4008576000.0,"low":4000827000.0,"high":4016325000.0,"numberOfAnalysts":2.0,"yearAgoRevenue":3909000000.0,"growth":0.0255,"currency":null},"0y":{"avg":15615726180.0,"low":15481010000.0,"hi